  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting rights, wellbeing and accountability through advocacy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of the project is that civil society organisations are involved in the development, review, adoption and implementation of national policies dealing with alcohol and drugs control, women and children&#x2019;s rights, anti-corruption, land tenure and environmental issues; and hold duty bearers accountable for effective implementation of relevant policies in Sierra Leone.</narrative>
  </description>
